<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In Fuel Gauge: Estimating Chain-of-Thought Length Ahead of Time in Large Multimodal Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>Ablation Study</span></a>
