<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A3.SS2" title="In Appendix C Ablation Study ‣ Fuel Gauge: Estimating Chain-of-Thought Length Ahead of Time in Large Multimodal Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.2 </span>Window Size for <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="f_{\text{sig}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>sig</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_{\text{sig}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A3.SS3" title="In Appendix C Ablation Study ‣ Fuel Gauge: Estimating Chain-of-Thought Length Ahead of Time in Large Multimodal Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.3 </span>Loss Function in Equation <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In Fuel Gauge: Estimating Chain-of-Thought Length Ahead of Time in Large Multimodal Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Overhead Analysis</span></a></li>
